## 3. Method (this report)

1. Bibliographic harvest via Europe PMC (`europepmc_bu2019.json`).
2. BV-BRC API queries for the exact strain (`L10`) and the species *S. chattanoogensis* (`bvbrc_L10_lookup.json`, `bvbrc_chattanoogensis_species.json`).
3. Cross-reference with NCBI / BioProject to confirm where the L10 reference genome lives.
4. Numerical sanity-check of the reported deletion magnitudes (1.3 Mb / 0.7 Mb) against typical *Streptomyces* genome sizes returned by BV-BRC.

